    "summary": "This model can't be your **WARLORD**.\n\nWhen **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** is your army faction, during Declare Battle Formations you can swap this model for another **OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM** model whose points value is no higher than this model's. No model may appear twice in your army, so after a swap it can have at most:\n\n- 1 **VINDICARE ASSASSIN**\n- 1 **CULEXUS ASSASSIN**\n- 1 **EVERSOR ASSASSIN**\n- 1 **CALLIDUS ASSASSIN**",
